    "caption": "乳癌可以喝豆漿吃黃豆嗎？別被早期傳統觀念給制約了！#黃豆 #大豆異黃酮 #乳癌",
    "audioUrl": "https://scontent-muc2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNmZQARlj5iOm5K-PHQcNm_KuXc_584_ZOlq84O_T4aHV-oz-UbQuKE6LYIhUGWsU8YPy4OO_6dphS78jxA6d1_.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-muc2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=zwxiPuTUMbMQ7kNvwEuIunw&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ny_wNBCC6X6ThWf3IIPauQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQNN2f2ZiB7wapzdy_ktt88cK0Xu4qt9tAP0qws_raUS4g&oe=6AC0FE6A",
